# RUN: FileCheck %s < %t/run.log

# The covered steps allocate NCCL's device coverage scratch. The command
# must finish the run and return success after releasing it.
# CHECK: nccl transport, directed traversal
# CHECK: DIST: interval step 2 halo_build min/mean/max
# CHECK: MDIR: ran in
